The red Gyarados appears in Pokémon Duel, as a variant of the figure. Shiny Gyarados was made available in version 5.0.4. This figure was available in during various Team Matches and also as a from October 1 to 16, 2018.



A red Gyarados mask was available to win for the top 3000 players in a Queen's Cup competition from June 20, 2019, to June 24, 2019.
